# Build packages: compilers and tools for the parts limde builds from source. Arch ships
# headers with the libraries, so this list is short.
# They stay installed so updates and rebuilds work without asking again.

## Build tools
base-devel          # the C compiler, make and makepkg (PCManFM is built as a local package)
git                 # downloads the pinned source code
pkgconf             # finds the libraries a build needs
wayland             # wayland-scanner, for Tinybar's and the shortcut helper's protocol code

## PCManFM (patched build)
autoconf            # prepares PCManFM's build scripts
automake            # prepares PCManFM's build scripts
libtool             # prepares PCManFM's build scripts
intltool            # PCManFM's translations
libfm-gtk3          # the file-manager library PCManFM is built on, with its GTK 3 widgets

## labwc (only while Arch's own is older than limDE's pin)
meson               # labwc's build system (with arch-meson)
scdoc               # labwc's manual pages
wayland-protocols   # protocol definitions labwc is built against
